From 44fe03c6a9a7d82468da0cb97d4e0a9e9ddff096 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Jakub=20Van=C4=9Bk?= <linuxtardis@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Jan 2026 19:29:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] generic: backport Motorcomm YT8821 PHY driver
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A recently introduced hardware revision of the Cudy WR3000H
router uses the Motorcomm YT8821 PHY chip on its 2.5G WAN port.
Backport the YT8821 enablement patch to the 6.6 kernel to make
the new WR3000H supportable on OpenWrt 24.10.

Signed-off-by: Jakub Vaněk <linuxtardis@gmail.com>
---
